                        "review": "A great homage to Might and Magic 1! Great art style. Good solid play. I didn't encounter any bugs. \n\n6 character slots, 6 classes. Just pick one of each and you are golden. Each class plays well and has uses throughout the game. Some puzzle elements, especially later in the game. \n\nDeveloper is supposedly working on a sequel which is supposed to be more in depth. I'll certainly buy it if it happens.",
